    transient_scope_untrack_skipped_cross_thread_or_borrowed_2026-11-26, 0, "Residual holes of the transient-scope stale-entry fix (22fb17305f0); see the Residual holes section of native_build_hir_sigsegv_under_20g_cgroup_cuda_port_closure_2026-11-22.md. Found by code reading, not reproduced."

